# W10.7 暂存 WAL 上传器：把 PostgreSQL 归档到本机暂存的密文上传 R2 的 wal/ 前缀，校验后删除本地副本。
# 与 auction-backup.service 共用 auction 账号、配置目录与 R2 令牌；不读写数据库。
# 暂存目录由归档命令（postgres 账号）写入，必须预建为 postgres:auction、2770（见 RECOVERY.md）。
[Unit]
Description=Auction WAL staging uploader
After=network-online.target
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
Type=oneshot
User=auction
Group=auction
WorkingDirectory=/opt/auction
UMask=0077
ExecStart=/opt/auction/bin/auction-cli --config-dir /etc/auction wal upload --staging-dir /var/lib/auction/wal-staging --budget-seconds 300
Restart=no
# CLI 总预算 300 秒；额外余量留给进程收口与 journal 落盘。
TimeoutStartSec=6min
TimeoutStopSec=60s
NoNewPrivileges=true
PrivateTmp=true
ProtectSystem=strict
ProtectHome=true
ProtectKernelTunables=true
ProtectKernelModules=true
ProtectControlGroups=true
RestrictSUIDSGID=true
LockPersonality=true
RestrictAddressFamilies=AF_UNIX AF_INET AF_INET6
ReadWritePaths=/var/lib/auction/wal-staging
StandardOutput=journal
StandardError=journal
